Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:05.14,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4280,5120)\pos(653.755,328.753)}Episode 80
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:05.14,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4280,5120)\pos(653.755,515.788)}Besieged at Mount Tielong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:03.62,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the sixteenth year of the Yanxi era of Shu-Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:05.87,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,253 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:08.02,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Grand General of Shu, Jiang Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:11.66,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,raised 200,000 troops to conquer the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:17.05,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In response, the Wei state sent Xu Zhi as the\N vanguard and Sima Zhao as Grand Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.62,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,They advanced to Longxi to resist the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:24.51,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,However, they did not expect Jiang Wei to feign defeat and behead Xu Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:29.73,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao could only lead the survivors to take refuge in Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:34.99,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,General, Mount Tielong is tall and narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.14,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,It can only be accessed by one pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.82,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,making it very defensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:40.70,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao has about six thousand soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.18,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,It may be hard to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:40.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4020,4420)\pos(301.333,493.333)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.01,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:51.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6860,7220)\pos(996,485.333)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:48.88,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,The mountain may be hard to besiege,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:50.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,but there is only one spring for water,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:52.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,barely enough for one hundred people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:54.94,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao only has six thousand soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:58.08,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,The water will soon run out and they will fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:30.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3500,3820)\pos(342.667,490.667)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:53.59,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,So the Heavens have forsaken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:57.37,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Commander, no need to be stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:59.98,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,The Overseer of Yong Province, Guo Huai,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:03.71,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,will certainly send troops to relieve us—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Guo Huai is resisting the Qiang troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.72,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,How can he send reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.22,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:52.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.72,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Move him. Give him a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.57,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Bury him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:18.30,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:43.47,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,General, where would you want to send your troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:46.04,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Commander Sima is trapped at Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:47.61,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,I'm going to relieve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:50.58,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei joined with the Qiang\N and wants to seize Nan'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.66,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Now that the Qiang have come,\N if you send reinforcements,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:56.51,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,the Qiang will seize that opportunity to ruin us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327.048,467.789)}Guō Huái\NStyled:Bójì
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:57.58,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Any suggestions?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:04:02.20,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Send someone to feign surrender \Nto the Qiang and take advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:04.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5350,5700)\pos(986.784,477.652)}Chén Tài\NStyled: Xuánbó
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.33,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Should the Qiang troops withdraw,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.74,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,we can then relieve the siege at Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:10.86,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.67,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,General, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:17.45,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:26.76,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Qiang King, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.14,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Guo Huai was getting suspicious of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.59,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,He wanted me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:39.36,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Today, I have no choice but to entrust myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:43.19,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,When we capture Yong Province, I will avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:43.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(983.965,212.759)}King of the Qiāng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:46.68,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,I know every detail about Guo Huai's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:49.34,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,I am willing to go rob their camp overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:52.18,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Once I enter their camp, there will be defections,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.74,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,ensuring our success!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.50,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,E'he Shaoge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:04:59.66,Default,E'he Shaoge,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:04.86,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,You and Chen Tai shall raid the\N Wei camp at the second watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.10,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,See if this is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:04.82,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,9:00 PM to 11:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.57,Default,E'he Shaoge,0,0,0,,Are your moles there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:24.04,Default,E'he Shaoge,0,0,0,,Shall we charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:24.73,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.73,0:05:25.22,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:29.20,Default,E'he Shaoge,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:31.70,Default,E'he Shaoge,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.98,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:53.55,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Pursue the Qiang and head straight for their base!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:57.38,Default,Qiang,0,0,0,,The Wei army is here, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:59.50,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,Do not run, do not panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:44.40,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,The court thought you were loyal and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.05,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Why did you rebel in favor of Shu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:48.65,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,I admit my guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.81,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,In that case, you shall be our vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:53.45,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Break the Shu army's siege of Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.94,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,The Emperor will reward us greatly upon victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.90,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,With such generosity from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:02.46,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,I shall help you destroy the Shu to repay the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.50,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Let us march to Mount Tielong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.98,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Let's go. This is unbearable. \NLet's go down the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:39.35,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:41.25,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:16.74,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,General,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.26,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,more Wei troops left the mountain to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.18,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,What has the mountain been like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:35.82,Default,Deserter Officer,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General, we sated our hunger and thirst \Non tree bark and moss for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.30,Default,Deserter Officer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The suffering was unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:45.54,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why did you not rush down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.04,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and fight to the death?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:52.11,Default,Deserter,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We fear your crossbows \Nthat can shoot ten arrows at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:53.65,Default,Deserter,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Would we dare go to our deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:54.54,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.05,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Settle them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:00.80,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.26,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When the Chancellor was in the upper valleys,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.94,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he was unable to capture Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:14.07,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That was his greatest regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:16.62,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now with the repeating crossbows of the Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:19.32,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I only need the Qiang here to ensure that Sima Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:20.90,Thinking,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}perishes on Mount Tielong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:27.16,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sima Zhao will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:05.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4800,5140)\pos(307.313,449.472)}Wáng Tāo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:01.06,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Commander, the situation is grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.80,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Prepare against anything detrimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:08.59,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,The only way to survive is to exit the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.14,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,But our army has no morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.70,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:20.58,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,You will bring every warrior to the cliff edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:24.72,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I have a plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:27.24,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.06,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.77,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,O Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:16.75,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I received an edict to repel the Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:19.58,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I only regret that being without ability and virtue,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:23.50,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I let six thousand good warriors be stuck on a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:28.19,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Without any water or food, our survival is uncertain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:39.23,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Let there only be one death today\N to serve as an apology to the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.46,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,After my death,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:46.40,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,all of you soldiers may surrender to Western Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:53.25,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Preserve your lives instead of becoming\N wronged ghosts in a foreign land!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:58.14,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,If the azure Heavens sees us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.87,0:12:05.11,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,bless the families of my soldiers\N with support for their rest of their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:12.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Bless the wives and the youthful and\N elderly kin of my soldiers with reunion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:17.43,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Even if I die, I will have no regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,All of you soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:28.78,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I, Sima Zhao, bid you farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:30.46,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.51,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Commander, do not do this, do not do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:45.32,Default,All,0,0,0,,Commander, do not do that, do not do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.73,Default,All,0,0,0,,Commander, do not do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:51.05,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Commander, your safety is attached to all of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:54.70,Default,All,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:57.72,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Will you continue to let me sin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:00.94,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Where will the sun and moon witness your loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:03.63,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,If you see death as returning home,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:06.34,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,why should we cling to our lives and fear death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:09.02,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,You would sacrifice yourself to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We can never repay such gratitude and virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.22,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:17.82,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,lead us down the mountain to fight for our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:22.59,Default,All,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:28.75,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Soldiers, your willingness to face danger \Nis as grand as the mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:31.58,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I pay my respects to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:34.45,Default,Wang Tao,0,0,0,,Commander! Commander, give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:38.40,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Soldiers, arm yourselves and prepare your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:42.18,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,We only wait for Guo Huai to arrive \Nto charge down the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:49.84,Default,All,0,0,0,,Charge down the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.82,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao sits trapped in the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:05.29,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,his army demoralized and without food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:08.40,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,We should attack him now.\NIt will be as easy as a turn of a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.24,Default,General,0,0,0,,Sir, the King of the Qiang has \Nled his army outside the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.06,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.71,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Have the Qiang garrison outside the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.31,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I shall receive the King of the Qiang in the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.02,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Welcome, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:55.84,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Apologies for my late reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.19,Default,King of the Qiang,0,0,0,,Advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:10.03,Default,Guo Huai,0,0,0,,Hurry, capture Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:10.99,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:42.86,Default,General,0,0,0,,Capture Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:00.17,Default,General,0,0,0,,Sir, there are sounds of battle below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Great, Guo Huai has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:05.11,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Soldiers, let us charge down together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:09.33,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.43,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.65,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,General Guo, capture Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:57.95,Default,General,0,0,0,,Capture Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:02.70,Default,General,0,0,0,,Capture Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.92,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,General Guo Huai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.18,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:23.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(329.868,463.562)}Cáo Fāng\NStyled: Lánqīng
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2340,2660)\pos(336.916,469.198)}Sīmǎ Shī\NStyled: Zǐyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:36.70,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Must you receive a servant of yours, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.58,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please be at ease, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:49.84,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Minister Sima, you defeated the Shu army
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:52.00,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and drove back Jiang Wei into Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:54.35,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That is a great achievement!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:57.21,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We shall reward you handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:57.95,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:03.79,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A nation is governed through fairness and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:07.98,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The most important deeds of the world\N are rewards and punishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:11.71,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not distinguishing the two would be a grave error.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:13.42,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sima Zhao did well by defeating the foe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:16.45,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but also erred by losing officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:20.10,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}As I see it, his merits excuse his faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:27.74,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Well, then there is no need to reward or punish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:34.54,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lead the imperial army to garrison by the Luo River.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.70,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Reward officers of merit handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:39.15,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Bury the Overseer of Yong, Guo Huai, with pomp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:41.64,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Feed the horses and drill the armies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:45.39,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We shall await the day we conquer Wu and Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.21,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Scram, all of you scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.74,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:26.53,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,The Sima brothers treat me like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:29.75,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,They treat the common people like weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:37.70,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Soon, the Altars of State, the rivers, \Nand the mountains will belong to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.14,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.74,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:50.66,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,Even though we lack talent, we will follow your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:54.34,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,We would gather heroes from \Nall directions to slay those traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:58.43,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,My uncle, Xiahou Ba, feared being\N murdered by the Sima brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:00.66,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,so he fled to Jiang Wei in Western Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:02.92,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,If Your Majesty so desires to slay the traitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:06.67,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,I can recall my uncle to join us against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.66,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,I only fear my will cannot be realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:12.59,Default,Zhang Ji,0,0,0,,We swear to be of the selfsame heart in slaying them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.42,Default,Zhang Ji,0,0,0,,in service to Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:15.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:17.15,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.07,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Grand General Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.02,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,His Majesty and Li Feng are in the rear palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:50.64,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Here is the imperial edict. Please keep it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:55.73,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,If it leaks, our lives will be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:00.94,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, why say such hopeless words?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:02.62,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,We are committed to the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:04.64,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:06.94,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:09.42,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,It will not be long before joyous news come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.06,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,You must be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:40.01,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Is there any reason why you three left court so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.77,0:22:45.00,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His Majesty had books in the inner court
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:48.10,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and had us read them aloud to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.83,0:22:58.98,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What sort of books?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:02.86,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Histories of the Xia, Shang, and Zhou dynasties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:08.42,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What did he ask after you read the books aloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:13.98,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He asked how Yi Yin supported the Shang
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:16.29,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and how the Duke of Zhou served as regent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.29,0:23:23.10,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We all said that you, Grand General Sima, \Nwere like Yi Yin and the Duke of Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.79,0:23:29.41,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why would you compare me to \NYi Yin and the Duke of Zhou?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:35.62,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Perhaps you look down upon me \Nlike Wang Mang and Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:37.15,Default,Zhang Ji & Li Feng,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:39.73,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are all your servants, Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.24,Default,Li Feng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dare we look down upon you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:41.90,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:44.54,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Lowly cajolers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:48.18,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Why did you share a tearful embrace \Nwith the Emperor in his bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:49.69,Default,Zhang Ji & Li Feng,0,0,0,,Tearful?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.69,0:23:50.94,Default,Zhang Ji & Li Feng,0,0,0,,That is simply false!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.94,0:23:53.78,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,There are tear marks on your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.938,421.292)}Zhāng Jī
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:23:59.90,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,And your eyes are still red!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.90,0:24:01.76,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Do you dare remain in denial?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.50,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,So if I were tearful?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:07.47,Default,Xiahou Xuan,0,0,0,,I am only tearful that an evil traitor \Nlike you is in the court of Great Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:07.94,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:12.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.361,493.151)}Xiàhóu Xuán\NStyled: Tàichū
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.59,0:24:15.38,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:25.23,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:33.66,Default,Zhang Ji & Li Feng,0,0,0,,Traitorous dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.14,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Slice them open in the market!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:36.54,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Exterminate their clans!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:39.50,Default,Zhang Ji & Li Feng,0,0,0,,Vile traitor! Filthy dog! May you die in misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:41.94,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,To the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.81,0:24:44.22,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.22,0:24:46.70,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,the Grand General is rushing towards the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.04,0:25:06.40,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My father installed you as emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.19,0:25:10.01,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His glory and virtue were not unlike the Duke of Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:12.38,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I was in loyal service to you;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.38,0:25:15.81,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}what makes mine different than that of Yi Yin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.81,0:25:17.77,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You instead saw kindness as misdeeds
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:19.71,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and saw merits as faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.71,0:25:23.70,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You went so far as to plot with traitors\N to hurt me and my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:26.24,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.89,0:25:29.58,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,We... We never had such thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:30.89,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,We never had such thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.77,0:25:34.50,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Then who made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:39.18,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,It... it was made under the duress of other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:40.38,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,We never had such thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.91,0:25:45.00,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,What is the crime for slandering a minister of treason?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:50.62,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,I am guilty, I am guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:54.78,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Please pardon me for the sake of \Nthe lord-to-subject relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.90,0:25:59.42,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,How can a ruler bow down to his subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.32,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Get up now, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.95,0:26:11.00,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,The laws of the nation must be upheld.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:15.37,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Where is the daughter of Zhang Ji now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:23.00,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Grand General, please pardon the Empress, \Nplease pardon the Empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:25.74,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,The laws of the nation! The laws of the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:30.70,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Take her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.15,0:26:33.90,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:38.66,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,All of your harm is my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.02,0:26:41.92,Default,Empress Zhang,0,0,0,,May you live long, and may you be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.03,0:26:45.61,Default,Empress Zhang,0,0,0,,For now, I bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:48.07,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:48.98,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.56,0:26:53.87,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:00.50,Default,Cao Fang,0,0,0,,Empress...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:08.62,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,May His Majesty succeed the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:22.97,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the sixth year of the Jiaping era of Wei, 254 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.97,0:27:25.89,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Shi deposed the King of Wei, Cao Fang,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.89,0:27:28.61,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and enthroned the grandson of Cao Pi,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.61,0:27:33.47,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the fourteen-year-old\N Township Duke of Gaogui, Cao Mao, as Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.47,0:27:36.38,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The era name was changed to the \Nfirst year of the Zhengyuan era
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.38,0:27:38.26,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and a general amnesty was declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:41.28,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Sima clan held dominance over the imperial court.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.52,0:28:05.82,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Soon after, Sima Shi removed a tumor on his left eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:07.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,but before the wound was healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:12.82,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he left to quell a rebellion in Huainan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:18.73,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The wound ruptured and he fell critically ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.73,0:28:21.33,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Knowing that he would not live any longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.33,0:28:27.78,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he summoned Sima Zhao from Luoyang to Xuchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:30.14,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,where he entrusted him with future affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:31.42,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.42,0:28:31.97,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.27,0:28:42.82,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother, elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:45.57,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:47.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.54,0:28:51.48,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Zhao, my younger brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:53.16,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Zhao, my younger brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:55.42,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I am here, elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.46,0:29:02.38,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:05.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,the seal of the Grand General is here, it is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.26,0:29:08.46,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,You must use it well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.27,0:29:10.94,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Use it well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.62,0:29:19.17,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,Younger brother, after you take my authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:24.12,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,do not entrust others with any major matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.08,0:29:29.98,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,If not,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.21,0:29:36.16,Default,Sima Shi,0,0,0,,you will destroy yourself and our clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.06,0:29:47.88,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:51.94,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.66,0:29:56.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.15,0:30:08.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,To Luoyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.78,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Grand General Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:28.40,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,the edict of the Son of Heaven is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.50,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The envoy is before the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:32.33,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Good, receive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:38.74,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.74,0:30:40.89,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,the General who Secures the West\N reports an emergency:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.89,0:30:43.96,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei of Western Shu is\N leading 200,000 troops to Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:47.30,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,The Shu army's advancement may be hard to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.54,0:30:47.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.771,474.834)}Jiǎ Chōng\NStyled: Gōnglǘ
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.95,0:30:51.78,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,The General who Secures the West,\N Deng Ai, has studied geography.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.78,0:30:54.92,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,He has already set up nine camps at Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:56.66,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,enough to deal with Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.51,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,What General Zhong has said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.90,0:31:02.78,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Order Deng Ai to repel Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.58,0:31:08.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2060,2460)\pos(948.722,435.382}Dèng Ài\NStyled: Shìzài
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.54,0:31:14.54,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I left an empty space at the\N mountain's base for Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.25,0:31:17.54,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I am confident he will set up camp there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.98,0:31:22.01,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Before Jiang Wei arrives, you must dig tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.18,0:31:27.63,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, your death is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:43.57,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Wait until you meet the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.22,0:31:46.70,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,I will have my words in when I meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.70,0:31:48.96,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Where is the General? Where is the General?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.58,0:31:52.46,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.93,0:32:02.58,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,What are you arguing over?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:05.29,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General Deng, he spoke ill of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.29,0:32:08.49,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,He said that you overestimate\N yourself and waste resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.49,0:32:10.26,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,He broke his digging equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:12.94,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,refusing to dig a tunnel to the mountain pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.33,0:32:16.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Why do you think I overestimate myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.12,0:32:19.94,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,How can we be sure that the\N Shu army will set up camp there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.72,0:32:23.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I studied books of war since I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.90,0:32:26.72,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Am I somehow worse than you, \Nan uneducated buffoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.72,0:32:29.70,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Does the amount of studying matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.70,0:32:30.82,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,If your plan fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.82,0:32:33.24,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,all of our half a month's work will be a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:37.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,In that case, do you dare to bet with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:39.86,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,What type of bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.06,0:32:43.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,If the Shu army does not set up camp here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.90,0:32:47.02,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I will tender my official seal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.64,0:32:54.28,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,What will you do if they set up camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.81,0:32:56.74,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.53,0:32:59.06,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I want your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.07,0:33:07.68,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Then I'd be willing to obey you and offer you my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.16,0:33:10.19,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.06,0:33:21.50,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, the Shu army set up three camps \Nat the valley's entrance to support one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:25.28,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,This was hardly outside my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:25.86,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Scout!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.86,0:33:26.32,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.01,0:33:29.30,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The General is amazing at predictions!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.30,0:33:32.28,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We're lucky he knew the terrain\N and left a space for the Shu camps!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.28,0:33:34.27,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes, our hard work was not in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.27,0:33:36.82,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,I didn't expect Jiang Wei to actually set up camp here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.42,0:33:40.10,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,General, you may test your blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:58.64,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Who is guarding the left camp of the Shu army?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.64,0:34:00.96,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Wang Han and Jiang Wenwu, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.17,0:34:05.34,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,They have not established stable camps yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:07.40,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We should disturb them tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.40,0:34:08.70,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Deng Zhong and Shi Zuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.70,0:34:09.33,Default,Deng Zhong & Shi Zuan,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.33,0:34:11.02,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Lead ten thousand troops each.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.02,0:34:15.41,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,When you see fires rise up at the left camp \Nat midnight, attack it from two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.41,0:34:16.16,Default,Deng Zhong & Shi Zuan,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:16.70,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Zheng Lun!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.70,0:34:17.42,Default,Zheng Lun,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:18.69,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Lead five hundred warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.69,0:34:22.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Take the tunnels towards the left camp at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.56,0:34:24.34,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Make sure to start fires everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:24.98,Default,Zheng Lun,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:41.10,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,You're a good man, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.10,0:34:44.06,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,I'll repay your generosity and virtue with my own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:32.86,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.71,0:35:50.70,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:00.43,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Set the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.29,0:36:07.46,Default,General,0,0,0,,Who is setting fires?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.02,0:36:09.78,Default,Zheng Lun,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.80,0:36:22.44,Default,General,0,0,0,,The enemy has attacked from the outside and inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:23.74,Default,General,0,0,0,,To the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:24.37,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:44.13,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.88,0:36:48.65,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General, the left camp has been lit on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.65,0:36:50.34,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We are under attack from Wei forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.34,0:36:52.46,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Our situation is critical, we cannot last!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.81,0:36:57.59,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Send reinforcements there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:58.80,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,I can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.80,0:36:59.50,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.69,0:37:03.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Anyone who acts rashly will be beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.89,0:37:10.34,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Sir, the left camp won't survive without our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.01,0:37:18.88,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Hearing the noises of battle from there,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:22.44,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,the Wei army must have soldiers \Nfrom the inside and outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:24.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,How can we act rashly if we do not know the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.82,0:37:27.69,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:30.10,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Hold your position once the enemy arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.10,0:37:31.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Strike back with arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.98,0:37:32.86,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.02,0:37:36.37,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:03.50,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Jiang Wei has a firm grasp of Kongming's tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.50,0:38:05.82,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Even at night, his troops are not frightened;
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.82,0:38:08.92,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}even in bedlam, he maintains order.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.92,0:38:11.20,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}An officer of remarkable talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.05,0:38:12.50,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ring the bells to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.63,0:38:18.25,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.63,0:38:21.50,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Please rise, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.44,0:38:26.56,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,We did not win the battle yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.10,0:38:29.10,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,It is not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:35.68,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,It was because I did not clearly understand the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.05,0:38:38.85,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.62,0:38:43.34,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Send men to fill the tunnels and reorganize the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.34,0:38:44.12,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.44,0:38:50.58,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Mount Qi is a critical area for warfare,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.58,0:38:52.58,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,where armies can be dispatched from.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.83,0:38:58.55,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Chancellor Zhuge went to Mount Qi \Nsix times, never going anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.42,0:39:00.42,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:01.42,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.04,0:39:03.78,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Return to camp to organize the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.78,0:39:06.62,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,We will fight Deng Ai at Mount Qi tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.62,0:39:07.69,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.26,0:39:12.28,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,My liege!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.02,0:39:15.78,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,A great victory at Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.06,0:39:17.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996.652,481.879)}Zhōng Huì\NStyled: Shìjì
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.17,0:39:23.77,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Deng Ai is truly an ingenious general!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:32.59,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Our initial victory at Mount Qi has \Nundermined the strength of the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.18,0:39:37.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Order the army to reward the officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.99,0:39:42.38,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,If you defeat Jiang Wei this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.38,0:39:46.18,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,every soldier will receive even more handsome gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:46.75,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.29,0:39:52.34,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei knows well the tactics of Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.24,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,He can deploy many tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.24,0:39:57.98,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,You must take precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.09,0:40:02.42,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,You should assemble the troops south of the Wei river,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.43,0:40:04.58,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,then set up camp at the south banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:07.26,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,In advancing, we can rush towards Mount Qi;
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.26,0:40:09.68,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,in retreating, we can fall back to the Wei river.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:12.28,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,This will prevent any potential error.

